<title>UK: Golf-Norman stays atop world golf rankings.</title>
<headline>Golf-Norman stays atop world golf rankings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greg Norman remains top of the world rankings issued on Monday. Colin Montgomerie moves back into fifth place after winning the European Grand Prix at the weekend.</p>
<p>Top 20 (U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>  1. Greg Norman (Australia)	 10.57 points average</p>
<p>  2. Tiger Woods			  9.79</p>
<p>  3. Nick Price			   9.20</p>
<p>  4. Tom Lehman			   9.06</p>
<p>  5. Colin Montgomerie (Britain)    8.73</p>
<p>  6. Steve Elkington (Australia)    8.67</p>
</text>
